[SUBTITLE] THE SIX AGENTS' RECOVERY LOG:
[TEXT] 'The six agents have been systematically recovering Old Net'
[TEXT] 'fragments since their deployment. Each fragment contains a piece'
[TEXT] 'of the Cold Signal—a recording of what happened before the'
[TEXT] 'corporation tried to bury it. The fragments are scattered across'
[TEXT] '54 different VNET sites. Recovering them all is the first step'
[TEXT] 'toward unlocking the truth. And the truth is waiting.'
